Description: settlement building game for touch screens
 Weiler plays the classic settlement building game of 1996 from the data
 of its Gold Edition, by the original rules (taken from Return to the
 Roots), with a new interface made for touch screens. It works just as
 well with mouse and keyboard, in portrait and landscape: free games
 against computer opponents, the Roman and the world campaign, saving and
 loading with several slots and an autosave.
 .
 The game data of the Gold Edition is not included. Weiler asks for its
 folder on the first start and remembers it. weiler-pack-data builds the
 local package weiler-data from the game folder or a CD image, for all
 users of the computer (bchunk and 7zip are needed for CD images).
